<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS3" title="In Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.3 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span>: Descent of sequence <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS4" title="In Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.4 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span>: Descent of accumulated asymmetric sequence <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi(P_{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi(P_{k})</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Additional Experiments and Experimental Setups</span></a>
