</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">By inequality (<a href="#A5.E58" title="Equation 58 ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a>), the last two terms in the  <span title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</span> (<abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr>) of (<a href="#A5.E51" title="Equation 51 ‣ Lemma E.1 (Descent lemma of lower-level problem). ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">51</span></a>) is bounded by</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx67" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
