<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex74.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\ \left(\frac{68\beta^{2}q_{\max}^{5}}{\alpha\gamma^{2}\mu q_{\min}^{4}}+\frac{12q_{\max}\eta^{2}}{\alpha q_{\min}^{2}\mu}\right)(f(\bar{W}_{k})-f^{*})+\alpha\sigma^{2}\left\|\frac{G_{p}(P_{k})}{\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}\right\|_{\infty}^{2}+\alpha^{2}Lq_{\max}^{2}\sigma^{2}+{\Theta}\left(\frac{\gamma q_{\max}\Delta w_{\min}}{q_{\min}^{2}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>68</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ \left(\frac{68\beta^{2}q_{\max}^{5}}{\alpha\gamma^{2}\mu q_{\min}^{4}}+\frac{12q_{\max}\eta^{2}}{\alpha q_{\min}^{2}\mu}\right)(f(\bar{W}_{k})-f^{*})+\alpha\sigma^{2}\left\|\frac{G_{p}(P_{k})}{\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}\right\|_{\infty}^{2}+\alpha^{2}Lq_{\max}^{2}\sigma^{2}+{\Theta}\left(\frac{\gamma q_{\max}\Delta w_{\min}}{q_{\min}^{2}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS1.p9.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(a)</annotation></semantics></math> uses <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{q_{\max}}{q_{\min}}\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{q_{\max}}{q_{\min}}\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>;
(b) comes from (<a href="#A5.E69" title="Equation 69 ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">69</span></a>);
(c) comes from (<a href="#A5.E52" title="Equation 52 ‣ Lemma E.1 (Descent lemma of lower-level problem). ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a>) in Lemma <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma E.1 (Descent lemma of lower-level problem). ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.1</span></a>; (d) holds by setting <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta\leq\frac{\beta q_{\max}^{2}}{\gamma q_{\min}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta\leq\frac{\beta q_{\max}^{2}}{\gamma q_{\min}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta\leq\frac{\gamma}{q_{\max}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta\leq\frac{\gamma}{q_{\max}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
(e) holds given <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS1.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> is sufficiently small.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">Substituting (<a href="#A5.E67" title="Equation 67 ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">67</span></a>) and (<a href="#A5.E70" title="Equation 70 ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">70</span></a>) back into (<a href="#A5.E66" title="Equation 66 ‣ Theorem . ‣ E.1 Main proof ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">66</span></a>) yields</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx77" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E71"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
