<p id="A5.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Next, we will handle each term in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E74" title="Equation 74 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.2 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊̄_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">74</span></a>) separately.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bound of the second term (a).</span>
To bound term (a) in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E74" title="Equation 74 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.2 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊̄_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">74</span></a>), we leverage the assumption that noise has expectation <math id="A5.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> (Assumption <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 3.2 (Unbiasness and bounded variance). ‣ 3.1 Basic Design ‣ 3 Dynamic SP Tracking Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>)</p>
<table id="A5.EGx82" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E75"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E75.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\ \mathbb{E}_{\xi_{k},b_{k}}[\left\langle\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k}),P_{k+1}-P_{k}\right\rangle]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ \mathbb{E}_{\xi_{k},b_{k}}[\left\langle\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k}),P_{k+1}-P_{k}\right\rangle]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(75)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex88"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex88.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex88.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\ \alpha\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{k},b_{k}}\left[\left\langle\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k})\odot\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})},\frac{P_{k+1}-P_{k}}{\alpha\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}+(\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k};\xi_{k})-\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k}))\odot\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}-\frac{b_{k}}{\alpha\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}\right\rangle\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ \alpha\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{k},b_{k}}\left[\left\langle\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k})\odot\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})},\frac{P_{k+1}-P_{k}}{\alpha\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}+(\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k};\xi_{k})-\nabla f(\bar{W}_{k}))\odot\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}-\frac{b_{k}}{\alpha\sqrt{F_{p}(P_{k})}}\right\rangle\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
