<p id="A5.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p">The second term in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E75" title="Equation 75 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.2 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊̄_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">75</span></a>) can be bounded by</p>
