<div id="A5.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">The third term in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E75" title="Equation 75 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.2 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊̄_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">75</span></a>) can be bounded by the bounded variance (Assumption <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 3.2 (Unbiasness and bounded variance). ‣ 3.1 Basic Design ‣ 3 Dynamic SP Tracking Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>)</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx84" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

