</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">Substituting (<a href="#A5.E91" title="Equation 91 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">91</span></a>) and (<a href="#A5.E93" title="Equation 93 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">93</span></a>) into (<a href="#A5.E90" title="Equation 90 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">90</span></a>), we bound the second term in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E89" title="Equation 89 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">89</span></a>) by</span></p>
