<p id="A5.SS3.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text">The third term in the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of (<a href="#A5.E89" title="Equation 89 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">89</span></a>) follows the Lipschitz continuity of the analog update (Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2 (( , , Lemma 2)). ‣ Appendix A Notations and Preliminaries" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>)</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx100" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex135"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
