<p id="A5.SS3.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text">Plugging (<a href="#A5.E94" title="Equation 94 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">94</span></a>) and (<a href="#A5.Ex135" title="In Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">95</span></a>) into (<a href="#A5.E89" title="Equation 89 ‣ Lemma . ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma : Descent of sequence 𝑊_𝑘 ‣ Appendix E Proof of Theorem : Convergence of Algorithm" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">89</span></a>) yields</span></p>
